BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5072f9ea-6e48-3075-b814-37e841f09fbd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
